WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.200
Yuru Yuri is starting!

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:20.370
NACHUYACHUMI! +
<b>Yuru Yuri</b>

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.000
yuru yuru I'm a nonki na lady
Yuru Yuri. I’m a carefree lady,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.920
kyoumo kibun ha joujousa baby
my spirits are higher than ever now, baby.

00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.740
nandakanda ittatte otoshigoro fourteen
After all’s said and done we’re fourteen,

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:32.960
so we are junior high school students
so we are junior high school students!

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.880
yuri yuri You are girly na tenshi
Yuru Yuri. You are a girly angel,

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.820
hair ga chotto nabiite cutie
hair aflutter, you are a cutie!

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.440
sansan kyoumo ii tenki da nihonbare
It’s a grand old sunny bright day!

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.240
minnade wasshoi saa wasshoi
Everyone now: Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.140
rashurashurashu
Rush! Rush! Rush!

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.720
asobitsukarete kaettanara
Coming home from a long day of play,

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.660
ofuro ga iiyu da na
a hot bath sounds like just the thing.

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:53.840
ichidokirino jinseidakara
You only get to live once,

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.760
tamerawazuni hora chuucho ha yamete
so don’t hesitate, don’t fret.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:58.960
imasugu tobidase
No time to think, just fly!

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.740
jinsei ha happy taidani baibee
Life is happy, so don’t be idle,

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:04.910
sunawachi happy go lucky de iijan
just be happy-go-lucky - why not?

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:08.420
ikitomattara hitomazu ocha demo nonde
If we come to a roadblock we can sit a moment and have tea,

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:10.740
rashurashurashushushu de OK
Rush! Rush! Rush! OK!

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.740
isseinose de goukaini diving
Get on your marks, and take a bold dive,

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.940
sunawachi nichijou koso daibouken
our every single day is an adventure!

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:20.390
amai aisu no youni toroketeku mainichi
The days go by like sweet ice cream melting.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.970
rashurashurashushushude OK sa
Rush! Rush! Rush! OK!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.060
otonaninattemo wasurenai
Even when we grow up we won’t forget this,

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.980
yurishurashurashushushu
Lily shu-ra-shu-ra-shu-shu-shu!

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:36.900
I’m going out!

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:38.400
Take care.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.710
Okay!

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.260
Huh?

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.890
Akari, you’re late!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.240
What? Weren’t we meeting at 3?

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:51.020
Doesn’t Akari Time entail arriving 30 minutes early?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.370
What kind of logic is that?

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:55.600
We thought we’d surprise you by matching your time.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.010
Oh! I get it.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:02.350
Kyouko-senpai, I did as you asked and wore clothes I don’t mind getting wet.

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:03.660
But what’s going on?

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:06.240
I brought a change of clothes too!

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:10.210
When I say “summer,” what is the logical response?

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.350
Shaved ice and watermelons?

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:13.800
Not quite.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:15.880
Gaming till you drop?

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.480
That sounds fun! Let’s do that sometime.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.050
Swimming pools, then?

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:21.200
Almost!

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:22.770
Is it homework?

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.720
Akari, you like homework, huh?

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:28.640
On such a hot day? What else?

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.020
Oh! Water balloons!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:34.700
I used to play with those! It’s been a while.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.120
Truly it is the activity of the season.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.420
Water fights, though? How childish.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.300
Excuse me?

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.900
Oh, Yui prefers adult play.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.650
Do you play with women?

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:49.450
What are you saying?!

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.000
So we play catch, like that.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.380
Looks fun!

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:06.510
It seems a bit difficult though.

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:09.120
If you drop it, it’ll go BOBOUH!

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:11.070
What kind of sound is that?

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:11.810
Think fast, Chinatsu-chan!

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.440
Okay, next is Akari-chan.

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:20.650
Remember: don’t let it burst!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.350
Here I go then.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.240
You’re doing good!

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.720
Here, Yui-chan!

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:32.580
Kyouko!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.790
Hey!

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.560
Oh sorry. My chest just kind of slipped.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.090
That doesn’t make sense.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:40.880
Again!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.300
Geez, Kyouko-senpai.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.550
What are you trying to do?!

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:50.880
Whatever happened to “let’s play catch”?

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:53.270
My heart is as the seasons.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.740
It is ever-changing.

00:04:55.740 --> 00:04:57.730
That’s some fast changing.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.270
You’re wide open!

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:02.570
Now you’ve done it!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:06.470
Looks like it’s just gonna be us getting each other soaked.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.870
They seem to be having fun.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.670
Akari, think fast!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.120
You surprised me!

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:18.460
Doesn’t it feel good?

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.700
Yeah, it feels nice and cool.

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:23.130
Yui-senpai, why don’t you join us?

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:24.420
Well...

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.050
Here goes!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.840
W-Wait!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.140
Why’s it three on one?!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.420
Akari-chan has sustained a direct hit!

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:39.930
Whoops, sorry!
Akari went BOBOUH!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.290
I’m completely drenched.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.200
Same here.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.800
Chinatsu-chan looks kind of different.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.920
Yui, you didn’t get very wet at all.

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:53.440
Really?

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:56.140
It’s a hot day. You ought to be wetter!

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:57.460
Let’s go for another round.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.540
What?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.980
Here goes!

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.110
Right back at you!

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.260
You’ve done it!

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:12.010
So cool!

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:13.390
Amazing, Yui-chan!

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:16.850
So sorry. Your bullets have no—

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:18.880
How’s this?!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.980
That’s not allowed!

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.110
Take that!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.570
That’s not allowed either!

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.100
If you’re going to play that way!

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:26.660
Not fair!

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:27.780
Look who’s talking!

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:30.120
You leave me no choice.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:31.660
Transform!

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.680
I am Anti-bully Ranger: Leaf Mask!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.540
You’re making fun of me!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.950
How dare you do that to the hero of justice?!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.180
Eat this!

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:43.560
I won’t lose to you!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.340
Come on, you two!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.340
Calm down!

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:00.460
So… who won?

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.060
Everyone lost.

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.540
So the trial continues.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.370
We’ll just say I lost.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.570
It’s getting dark.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:12.220
If we go home like this we might catch the cold.

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:16.330
Of course! Let’s change together in the shade of that tree!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.840
You’ll be reported.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:20.720
We can use the bath back home.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.680
Bathing with Yui-senpai?

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.800
Thank you, Yui-chan!

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:28.640
I wonder what we’ll do tomorrow?

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.040
Tomorrow’s a school day.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:32.300
Oh that’s right!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.970
Akari-chan, you forgot, didn’t you?

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.770
I’m telling you, I saw them!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.820
Oh, Sakurako.

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:45.770
Just look at me!

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:46.920
Do I look like I’m lying to you?!

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.610
Good morning!
Do I look like I’m lying to you?!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.560
That face! You don’t believe me, do you?!

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.580
Of course I believe you.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.940
What’s the matter?

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:59.330
Akari-chan!

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.560
Listen to this!

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:05.180
You see, last night, on the way home from the grocery shop, I saw ghosts!

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:07.320
The ghosts of four young girls,

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:10.760
drenched in water and staggering down the street!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:15.220
What? Ghosts? That’s freaky.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.770
Chinatsu-chan, have you ever seen a ghost before?

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:18.550
You’d have cried for sure!
Chinatsu-chan, have you ever seen a ghost before?

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:19.330
You’d have cried for sure!

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:20.450
Not true.

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.780
No, I’m sure you would!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.600
It’s true!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:28.620
Where’d you see them?

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.190
It was near the park at Icchome.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:33.600
It’s dangerous, you better not get close!

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.530
<i>What should we do…</i>

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.870
Disarming that situation was too much work.

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.080
Sakurako-chan was really excited.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.260
So that’s what happened.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:51.360
The Oomuro house must be near that park.

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.210
Speaking of that,

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.040
we’ve never been there before, have we?

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.580
Why don’t we go visit sometime?

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.670
Good idea.

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.180
Okay, gather ’round.

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:03.440
Look what I have brought you today.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:09.520
I was thinking we have to leave a record of our shining day to day activities.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:12.030
Here we go then!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.100
Say cheese!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:18.380
I want to make that picture my wallpaper!

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:20.940
I didn’t know you had a computer, Chinatsu-chan.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:22.570
No, I mean for my room.

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:24.020
Wallpaper for your room?!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.620
Over here, Akari.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:29.360
Say cheese!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.050
Why’re you doing rapid shots?!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.520
Kyouko-chan!

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:37.100
You didn’t move enough.

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:38.180
We’re retaking it.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:41.360
Then you should have told me!

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:43.880
How about you try some sort of action?

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:48.920
M-Maybe like this?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:53.080
I don’t know... Maybe it should be a bigger action.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.660
How about headbanging?

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:55.400
Headbanging?!

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.240
Yeah! I bet we can get some cool shots that way!

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.420
Is this good, Kyouko-chan?!

00:10:00.420 --> 00:10:03.560
Great! Put your back into it!

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:05.040
Like this?!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.720
That’s incredible, Akari-chan!

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:09.500
Can’t she just do a jump?

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:13.300
Don’t you wanna see something unusual?

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.080
Oh… That’s the idea, huh?

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:17.460
Can I stop yet?!

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:19.360
Alright, here we go.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:21.520
Only one shot?!

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.720
Oh... I forgot!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.800
Kyouko-chan...

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.620
Whoops! Sorry!

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.340
Kyouko, how about we shoot you?

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:32.150
Yeah, I’ve been taking all the pictures.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:39.540
Take a picture of me with a backdrop of the great wild!

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:40.740
Okay…

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.140
Say cheese.

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:46.020
I think you blinked.

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:47.200
Really?

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.980
Yeah, you did.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:50.960
One more time.

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.300
Oh well...

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.140
You’re fine with that pose?

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.860
Isn’t it cool?

00:10:57.860 --> 00:10:59.930
Sure, whatever.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:00.990
Here we go.

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:03.640
You blinked again.

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.300
I’m bad with flash photography.

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:09.320
Oh I know! If I roll my eyes back I won’t be blinded!

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:11.650
That’s freaky! What are we shooting here?!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.640
Fine, we’ll go without the flash.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.480
There’s enough natural light, I suppose.

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.360
Akari-chan.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.220
Are you okay?

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:23.000
Yeah, I’m okay.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.560
Let’s take a picture together!

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:29.240
Yeah! Yui-chan, will you take it?

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:30.580
Okay.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.790
You’re a little too far apart.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:36.940
How’s this?

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:38.400
Come on, get closer!

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:41.620
Closer, closer.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:42.130
There!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.280
This won’t do!

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:46.040
Like this, Akari-chan!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.850
Yeah, that’s a cute picture.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:54.420
Yay! Thank you.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:58.280
I want to take one with Yui-chan next.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:00.640
Yeah, let’s.

00:12:00.640 --> 00:12:03.400
If we’re taking pair shots, let’s switch it up a bit.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:05.760
I guess you’re right.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.220
Akari, Akari.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:08.840
Okay!

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:17.940
Ch-Ch-Ch-Chinatsu-chan! They’ll come off!

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:21.570
I’m sorry! My jealousy got the better of me!

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:24.260
In that case, you too.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.650
I think that’s gonna be a great picture!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:37.610
Make sure you make prints of that! Giant size!

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:40.070
Now it’s my turn.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.820
No need to restrain yourself.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:55.060
Oh Yui. Always so shy.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:56.500
I could not restrain myself.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.460
I am a little bit jealous.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:04.420
Now let’s take some facial expressions we don’t usually get to see.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:05.720
Like Yui smiling wide.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.520
I also would like to see you with a big smile!

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:12.060
Me too!

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.360
Come on.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:27.800
Yui-senpai!

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:29.070
It was really cute!

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:33.330
It was beautiful! So don’t lock yourself in here!

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:37.100
Aren’t you all forgetting something?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.960
Does this camera ring any bells?

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:46.520
Isn’t that the same camera we took on the camping trip?

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:48.950
In other words…

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.040
Camping pictures?

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:55.600
Camping pictures!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.900
There’s so many!

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:03.660
Kyouko-chan, can I pick them up?

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.380
These are well photographed.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:12.380
Yui-senpai looks wonderful here!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.000
I-It’s...

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.500
It’s the miracle shot!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.210
Akari, you have a miracle shot too.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.460
Come on, Kyouko-chan!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:27.610
What part of that is a “miracle”?!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:30.340
Geez.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:34.300
Don’t you make that face when you’re sleeping too?

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:39.230
Oh, come on. I can’t have you picking on me too.

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:42.600
Yeah, I’ve seen it too.

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:47.460
One time I turned over at night and saw you with half closed eyes. That was a surprise.

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:48.450
Really?!

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:51.640
I didn’t know…

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.520
Forget that. Look at this!

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.120
Forget it?!

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:59.280
Wow, we took this photo?

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:01.250
It’s kind of embarrassing.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:04.320
But I like this picture.

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:06.360
Me too.

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.680
This is that picture that was taken without my consent.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:11.800
How embarrassing!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.760
You took this yourself!

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:16.160
For crying out loud.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.300
Hey, look at this picture.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.810
When was this?

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:26.280
Oh, that.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.570
Oh I remember!

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:30.640
Thanks by the way.

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:35.030
I mean… back then.

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.830
Alrighty!

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:45.780
Let’s go show these to the student council.

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:47.090
Yeah!

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:54.040
We took a lot of pictures!

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:57.120
It’s because everybody helped take lots of pictures.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:59.740
I snapped a lot of pictures too!

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:01.820
And a fine job you did, Private Sakurako.

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:08.640
Why did Toshinou Kyouko bring her flute again?

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:10.740
I don’t think she needed a reason.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:11.860
Be silent!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:15.560
Didn’t you enjoy my wonderful live flute performance?

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:18.020
You mean the “hee hee hoo” sound we heard?

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:21.460
I put all of my feelings at the time into that performance.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:26.080
Yeah, I was so full I thought I might give birth!

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:29.220
My sincerest congratulations.

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:33.380
That curry I made was just too delicious. There was no helping it!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.220
Yes, of course.

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:51.460
Sakurako!

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:55.550
Hey, you don’t know that it was me!

00:16:55.550 --> 00:17:00.100
You’re right. I don’t.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.160
But it was, right?

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.300
See!

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:07.290
For goodness’ sake! You never change.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:10.050
I had to babysit you the whole trip.

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:11.640
What did you say?

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:14.170
I could say the same! I had to…

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.520
You look like you’re enjoying that.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:25.500
Chinatsu-chan made that.

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:28.900
It was a simple meal,
with mackerel and lots of other ingredients.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.480
How embarrassing!

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.520
That really wasn’t my best cooking at all!

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.480
But it was really tasty.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:39.760
I wanted to have some.

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:43.080
Yoshikawa, you must be good at cooking.

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:45.980
In that case...

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:49.960
Next time I’ll make something that’ll really shock and surprise you!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.300
I’ll do my very best!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.780
No… You must be very busy after all.

00:17:56.780 --> 00:18:00.020
You don’t have to put quite so much effort into it.

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:02.180
No way! I know that if I put my all into it,

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:04.180
my bond with Yui-senpai will deepen,

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.640
and a beautiful new story will bloom!

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.810
Isn’t that nice?

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.960
No, I’m not…

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:14.060
I like it too!

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:18.540
Hey, everyone. Just write your names on the back of any pics you want.

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.080
I can get them printed.

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:21.380
Hooray!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.260
Is that OK?

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:24.790
Thank you.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.280
<i>I want this picture…</i>

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:30.630
<i>But will Toshinou Kyouko think I’m weird?</i>

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.710
I found a picture of Ikeda-senpai and me!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:37.100
Oh, I want that one too.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.300
Ikeda-senpai.

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.820
When I’m mature enough,

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:43.900
please explain what it was you were talking about that time!

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:50.420
I’d just like to say something:

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:52.900
I’m going to write my name on this photo,

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.580
but it’s not because I want a picture with you in it.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:19:01.050
I’d say the same thing. Make no mistake.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:04.180
You’re really busy, aren’t you?

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.520
Chinatsu-chan! I found another one.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:10.920
Thank you. Put it there!

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.130
Akari, why do you seem so used to this?!

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.100
Sugiura Ayano

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:21.680
You seem very happy.

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:24.100
Yeah, kind of.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:28.390
I kind of want all of the pictures.

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:30.600
I get what you mean.

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:27.920
We had a lot of fun.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.910
I want to do it again.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:38.780
Yeah.

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:41.300
It was so fun, the time just flew by.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.820
We should go camping together again.

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:44.900
I agree!

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.030
I can hardly wait.

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:49.470
We’ve still got half the summer vacation ahead of us.

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:52.430
Oh? Don’t you mean vaca<i>-chuu-</i>n?

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:55.400
Kyouko-chan! Forget about that!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:03.940
President!

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:06.220
We have a picture of you too.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.500
Hey! Who would do this?!

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.720
Who took a picture of me sleeping?

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:19.590
Asleep?!

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:21.670
And here’s one of me.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:23.010
Whoa.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:25.420
Yikes! Me too.

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:26.620
Oh my.

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:28.560
You’re right...

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:32.300
Wait, is there one of Kyouko?

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.020
So that means...

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.440
I will have them framed nicely.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:44.260
Don’t frame them!

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:45.460
Toshinou Kyouko!

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:47.380
I’ll confiscate those pictures!

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:49.160
Oh, Yui-senpai, please give me yours too.

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:50.540
Um, Chinatsu-chan?

00:21:50.540 --> 00:21:54.780
It’s kind of pointless though.
I’ve already seen Himawari’s sleeping face.

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:55.880
What did you say?

00:21:55.880 --> 00:21:58.740
I’m tired of seeing you asleep too, believe me!

00:21:58.740 --> 00:22:02.340
I really do sleep with half closed eyes…

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:25.000
Chikyuu wo ofuton ni shite ohirune shite
We make the Earth our bed and take a nap,

00:22:25.130 --> 00:22:30.800
soshitara taiyou sanzan kakebuton
then the bright sun becomes our blanket.

00:22:30.930 --> 00:22:36.560
okitara nandaka choppiri samishikute
I’m a bit sad when we have to wake up,

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:42.230
onaka mo suitashi isshyoni kaerou
I’m hungry, too, so let’s go home together.

00:22:42.350 --> 00:22:47.940
ashita ha donna koto ga okoru kana
I wonder what will happen tomorrow?

00:22:48.070 --> 00:22:53.610
yurukute aa subarashiki kono sekai
So laid back, ah, this wonderful world!

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:59.370
ashita mo kimi to kokode ohirune wo
I know I’ll take a nap with you here again.

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:05.080
mitsumeru mabutonoura universe
Staring into the universe behind closed eyes.

00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:10.800
hoshizora annani tsukiga takainoni
Even though the moon is so high in the starry sky,

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:22.230
kimi no sei kana nazeka nemurenai
I wonder if it’s because of you that I can’t sleep?

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:32.940
nemurenai
...I can’t sleep.
